{"id":63,"name":"Al-Munafiqun","nameAr":"المنافقون","nameFr":"Les hypocrites","place":"madinah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"63:1","fr":"Quand les hypocrites viennent à toi, ils disent : \"Nous attestons que tu es certes le Messager d’Allah\" ; Allah sait que tu es vraiment Son Messager ; et Allah atteste que les hypocrites sont assurément des menteurs.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/063001.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِذَا","en":"When","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/063_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"جَآءَكَ","en":"come to you","tr":"jāaka","l":"جاءَ","r":"جيأ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","en":"the hypocrites","tr":"l-munāfiqūna","l":"مُنافِق","r":"نفق","p":"nom","a":"wbw/063_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"قَالُوا۟","en":"they say","tr":"qālū","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"نَشْهَدُ","en":"We testify","tr":"nashhadu","l":"شَهِدَ","r":"شهد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّكَ","en":"that you","tr":"innaka","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"لَرَسُولُ","en":"(are) surely (the) Messenger","tr":"larasūlu","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/063_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en":"(of) Allah","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/063_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱللَّهُ","en":"And Allah","tr":"wal-lahu","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/063_001_010.mp3"},{"t":"يَعْلَمُ","en":"knows","tr":"yaʿlamu","l":"عَلِمَ","r":"علم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّكَ","en":"that you","tr":"innaka","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_001_012.mp3"},{"t":"لَرَسُولُهُۥ","en":"(are) surely His Messenger","tr":"larasūluhu","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/063_001_013.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱللَّهُ","en":"and Allah","tr":"wal-lahu","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/063_001_014.mp3"},{"t":"يَشْهَدُ","en":"testifies","tr":"yashhadu","l":"شَهِدَ","r":"شهد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_001_015.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّ","en":"that","tr":"inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_001_016.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en":"the hypocrites","tr":"l-munāfiqīna","l":"مُنافِق","r":"نفق","p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_001_017.mp3"},{"t":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en":"(are) surely liars","tr":"lakādhibūna","l":"كاذِب","r":"كذب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/063_001_018.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"63:2","fr":"Ils prennent leurs serments pour bouclier et obstruent le chemin d’Allah. Quelles mauvaises choses que ce qu’ils faisaient !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/063002.mp3","w":[{"t":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","en":"They take","tr":"ittakhadhū","l":"اتَّخَذَ","r":"أخذ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","en":"their oaths","tr":"aymānahum","l":"يَمِين","r":"يمن","p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"جُنَّةًۭ","en":"(as) a cover","tr":"junnatan","l":"جُنَّة","r":"جنن","p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_002_003.mp3"},{"t":"فَصَدُّوا۟","en":"so they turn away","tr":"faṣaddū","l":"صَدَّ","r":"صدد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_002_004.mp3"},{"t":"عَن","en":"from","tr":"ʿan","l":"عَن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/063_002_005.mp3"},{"t":"سَبِيلِ","en":"(the) Way","tr":"sabīli","l":"سَبِيل","r":"سبل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/063_002_006.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en":"(of) Allah","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/063_002_007.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّهُمْ","en":"Indeed, [they]","tr":"innahum","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/063_002_009.mp3"},{"t":"سَآءَ","en":"evil is","tr":"sāa","l":"ساءَ","r":"سوأ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_002_010.mp3"},{"t":"مَا","en":"what","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/063_002_011.mp3"},{"t":"كَانُوا۟","en":"they used to","tr":"kānū","l":"كانَ","r":"كون","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_002_012.mp3"},{"t":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en":"do","tr":"yaʿmalūna","l":"عَمِلَ","r":"عمل","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/063_002_013.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"63:3","fr":"C’est parce qu’en vérité ils ont cru, puis rejeté la foi. Leur cœurs donc, ont été scellés, de sorte qu’ils ne comprennent